('<lesson_id>', 'text', replace($blk${"html": "<h3>READING</h3><p>Прочитай текст и ответь на вопросы ниже.</p><h3>A Family Video Call</h3><p><img src=\"@@MEDIA@@gg2/u3/video_call.webp\" alt=\"\" style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:240px\"></p><p>It's Sunday evening at the Wilson family's house in Manchester. Everyone is at home, but they aren't sitting together — they're all using technology!</p><p>In the living room, Mum is having a video call with Grandma. Grandma lives in Scotland and they talk every Sunday. Mum is showing her some new photos on the screen.</p><p>Dad is in the kitchen. He's wearing his big headphones and listening to a podcast about football. He often does this when he cooks dinner.</p><p>Upstairs, twelve-year-old Lucy is in her bedroom. She's chatting online with her best friend Mia about their school project. They're both worried about their History test on Monday.</p><p>Lucy's brother Jake is fourteen. He's not very interested in school today — he's playing a computer game with his friends and laughing loudly!</p>"}$blk$, '@@MEDIA@@', 'https://classroom.wowteach.ru/media/')::jsonb, 8),
('<lesson_id>', 'quiz', replace($blk${"questions": [{"q": "Where are the Wilsons today?", "type": "single", "options": [{"text": "At Grandma's house"}, {"text": "In a café"}, {"text": "At home"}, {"text": "At school"}], "correct": [2]}, {"q": "Why is Mum showing Grandma photos?", "type": "single", "options": [{"text": "Grandma is in their house"}, {"text": "They are having a video call"}, {"text": "Grandma is taking selfies"}, {"text": "Mum is sending an email"}], "correct": [1]}, {"q": "What is Dad doing?", "type": "single", "options": [{"text": "Watching football on TV"}, {"text": "Cooking and listening to a podcast"}, {"text": "Talking on the phone"}, {"text": "Eating dinner"}], "correct": [1]}, {"q": "Why is Lucy talking to Mia?", "type": "single", "options": [{"text": "Mia is in their kitchen"}, {"text": "They're worried about a test"}, {"text": "They're playing a game together"}, {"text": "Mia is her sister"}], "correct": [1]}, {"q": "Jake is…", "type": "single", "options": [{"text": "doing his homework"}, {"text": "studying with Lucy"}, {"text": "having fun with his friends online"}, {"text": "helping his dad in the kitchen"}], "correct": [2]}]}$blk$, '@@MEDIA@@', 'https://classroom.wowteach.ru/media/')::jsonb, 9),
